global Poang

on findusprat Nr
  [  0] getparam 0 .............................. <Nr>
  [  2] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  5] eq ...................................... <Nr = 2>
  [  6] jmpifz [ 13] ............................ if Nr = 2 then
  [  9] pushcons 0 .............................. <"f_SPIK05">
  [ 11] setlocal 0 .............................. Ljud = "f_SPIK05"
  [ 13] getglobal 7 ............................. <Poang>
  [ 15] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 18] lt ...................................... <Poang < 7>
  [ 19] jmpifz [ 32] ............................ if Poang < 7 then
  [ 22] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 25] getlocal 0 .............................. <Ljud>
  [ 27] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2, Ljud>
  [ 29] extcall 81 .............................. puppetSound(2, Ljud)
  [ 32] ret
end
